<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">windlace-bindings</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Enchanted ankle-bindings, woven from cord too fine to trust with the
eye, that pull faintly at the wearer a half-beat ahead of whatever wind
is moving. Laced tight, they seem to lean forward on their own, urging
the step that follows before it is fully taken. Loosen them and the lean
goes with them, patient, waiting to be worn again.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting_circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Binding Paste (x1), Chrysalis Setting (x1), Oak Bark (x1)

